{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國流行音樂天后Taylor Swift玩鄉謠音樂出身，昨日她就出席於田納西州納什維爾舉行的年度鄉謠音樂界盛事《第60屆美國鄉謠音樂獎》（CMA），今次是她相隔10年後再次出席該頒獎禮。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;上次她任《</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:03:55.312873+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:06:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T01:57:17.687427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:57:17.687427+00:00","content_hash":"89414c9464019aded6d3f8311dcbb106b1528950a3f75b5f5835ad08e7daf804","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}